    }
   ],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false
  },
  {
   "id": "e26",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1264,
   "y": 298.75,
   "width": 558.62,
   "height": 212.5,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1289560150,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 2126508551,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Fixes to the notes\n• K + V = 512 + 512 = 1,024   (not 1012)\n• '2Kb' → 2 KiB: capital B = bytes, b = bits\n• 64 KiB × 100K = 6.55 GB = 6.10 GiB.\n  '6.4 GB' mixes KB (1000) with KiB (1024)\n• d_model / embed dim is NOT in the formula —\n  only H_kv × d_h. Q heads cost FLOPs, not cache\n• Q is never cached: used once per step, then dropped\n• Prefill writes T tokens of KV in one pass;\n  every decode step appends 1 token and READS all t",
   "originalText": "Fixes to the notes\n• K + V = 512 + 512 = 1,024   (not 1012)\n• '2Kb' → 2 KiB: capital B = bytes, b = bits\n• 64 KiB × 100K = 6.55 GB = 6.10 GiB.\n  '6.4 GB' mixes KB (1000) with KiB (1024)\n• d_model / embed dim is NOT in the formula —\n  only H_kv × d_h. Q heads cost FLOPs, not cache\n• Q is never cached: used once per step, then dropped\n• Prefill writes T tokens of KV in one pass;\n  every decode step appends 1 token and READS all t",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "e25",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
