   "text": "MLA row: DeepSeek ratio d_c = 4·d_h, d_R = d_h/2, caching ONE latent per token (no ×2 for K,V): (256 + 32) × 2 B × 32 L = 18 KiB/token.\nReal DeepSeek-V3: (512 + 64) × 2 B × 61 L ≈ 68.6 KiB/token with 128 query heads — MHA at that width would be ~57× larger.\n06_mla.md passes MLA through kv_cache_bytes() (×2), so its table shows MLA at 2× its true size.",
   "originalText": "MLA row: DeepSeek ratio d_c = 4·d_h, d_R = d_h/2, caching ONE latent per token (no ×2 for K,V): (256 + 32) × 2 B × 32 L = 18 KiB/token.\nReal DeepSeek-V3: (512 + 64) × 2 B × 61 L ≈ 68.6 KiB/token with 128 query heads — MHA at that width would be ~57× larger.\n06_mla.md passes MLA through kv_cache_bytes() (×2), so its table shows MLA at 2× its true size.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
