   "versionNonce": 364120812,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "for each query head h  (its group g = h ÷ 4):\n  s   = q_h · K_g[1..t]ᵀ / √64    t scores\n  a   = softmax(s)                 who matters?\n  o_h = Σ_i a_i · V_g[i]           64-d summary\nThe 4 heads of a group read the SAME K_g, V_g\nbut ask different questions (q_h) → different\nweights → different mixtures of the past.",
   "originalText": "for each query head h  (its group g = h ÷ 4):\n  s   = q_h · K_g[1..t]ᵀ / √64    t scores\n  a   = softmax(s)                 who matters?\n  o_h = Σ_i a_i · V_g[i]           64-d summary\nThe 4 heads of a group read the SAME K_g, V_g\nbut ask different questions (q_h) → different\nweights → different mixtures of the past.",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
